            "review_text": "BradfordSeward\nCalgary, Canada21 contributions\n0\nAngel Palace Restaurant - excellent breakfast, wonderful staff!\nMar 2019 • Solo\nThe breakfast buffet was really impressive with a wide variety of Vietnamese salads & cooked dishes, fresh fruits & fruit juices, bread & pastries, coffee & tea, etc. The staff was very motivated, attentive and friendly. They even offered to prepare eggs to order for me! I really enjoyed my stay at the Angel Palace not only for the nice facilities and great food but also because the staff were so friendly and helpful. The door man even came out to escort me across the street in busy traffic a few times. Amazing service!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2019",
