            "review_text": "David S\nStaunton, Virginia157 contributions\n0\nTasteless Last Meal in Vietnam\nOct 2015 • Solo\nIt was my last meal in Vietnam, where I had travelled for a week. The food in Vietnam has been excellent. But this restaurant was terrible. I ordered red wine and it came cold. I ordered a Caesar salad and the dressing was mayonnaise. I ordered ribeye steak and it was not the cut I know as a ribeye. It was also tough and overcooked - and had no taste. No taste to the vegetables that came with it. Salt did not help. This was the worst meal I've had in my memory.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 31, 2015",
